## S 5d. Set Topic Tag (before body paste)

Input: `topicTag` = `queries.json → hashtags[0]` with leading `#` stripped. Empty/missing → skip silently. Failure never blocks publish — topic is nice-to-have, body is the payload.

```bash
exec curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3847/api/browser/{{browser_profile}}/evaluate -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @- <<'ENDJSON'
{"fn":"async () => { var tag = window.__data.topicTag; if (!tag) return { skipped: 'empty' }; var dialog = document.querySelector('[role=\"dialog\"]'); var input = dialog && dialog.querySelector('input[placeholder=\"Add a topic\"]'); if (!input) return { skipped: 'no_input' }; input.focus(); var setter = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(HTMLInputElement.prototype, 'value').set; setter.call(input, tag); input.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 1000)); input.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', { key: 'Enter', bubbles: true })); return { set: tag }; }", "data": {"topicTag": "TOPIC_TAG_HERE"}}
ENDJSON
```

